# A receivable, financed by a bank and then sold. A core enterprise (the
# issuer) owes its supplier for goods delivered, payable at maturity. The
# supplier pledges the receivable to a bank for a loan; once the loan is
# repaid, the bank releases it, and the supplier sells it to a factoring
# company, which the issuer pays at maturity. The core enterprise's ledger
# keeps the receivable; each party consents on its own ledger.
contract ReceivableFinancing
parties issuer, supplier

asset Receivable
  amount CNY
  due date
  holder supplier

# The standard library's terms: the holder pledges, and the pledgee
# consents; only an active receivable can be pledged, so never twice at once;
# the pledgee releases its pledge; the holder sells it (transfer), and the
# buyer consents, but not while it is pledged; the issuer says it paid, and
# the payee (the pledgee, if any, else the holder) confirms. The contract's
# own rule: above CNY 5,000,000 the holder proves presence in person.
can pledge
  over 5_000_000 requires in person
can release
can transfer
can pay
can confirm payment
when due issuer pays

# Its tests: bo test runs each on an instance of its own, as the ledger
# would, every party a ledger of its own.
test "pledged, refused a second pledge, released, sold, paid at maturity"
  issuer issue with amount = CNY 1_250_000, due = 2027-04-06
  supplier pledge to bank1 -> pledged
  supplier pledge to bank2 -> refused "bo:state pledge"
  supplier transfer to factor1 -> refused "bo:state transfer"
  bank1 release -> active
  supplier transfer to factor1 -> active
  issuer pay at 2027-04-06 -> paid
  factor1 confirm payment -> settled

test "the bank consents to its pledge, the buyer to its purchase"
  issuer issue with amount = CNY 1_250_000, due = 2027-04-06
  supplier pledge to bank1 -> consent of bank1
  supplier transfer to factor1 -> consent of factor1

test "only the holder pledges or sells, and only the pledgee releases"
  issuer issue with amount = CNY 1_250_000, due = 2027-04-06
  bank1 pledge to bank1 -> consent of supplier
  factor1 transfer to factor1 -> consent of supplier
  supplier pledge to bank1 -> pledged
  supplier release -> consent of bank1

test "while pledged, the bank is the payee"
  issuer issue with amount = CNY 1_250_000, due = 2027-04-06
  supplier pledge to bank1 -> pledged
  issuer pay -> paid
  supplier confirm payment -> consent of bank1
  bank1 confirm payment -> settled

test "above CNY 5,000,000 the holder proves presence"
  issuer issue with amount = CNY 8_000_000, due = 2027-04-06
  supplier pledge to bank1 -> refused "bo:in-person pledge"
  supplier pledge to bank1 in person -> pledged
